  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Plan Nacional Infraestructura Rural Transporte</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Infrastructure Transport Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THIS PROBGRAM CALLS FOR THE REHABILITACION AND IMPROVEMENT OF URAL ROADS, WITH A TENTAIVE GOAL OF 2,000 KM IN THE FIRST EXECUTION YEAR, AS WELL AS RUAL AIRPORTS AND SAVE HARBORS. THE PROGRAM ALSO INCLUDES TECHNICAL ASISTANCE TO IMPROVE THE ADMINISTRATIVE CAPACITY OF PROVINCIAL AND MUNICIPAL NETWORKS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
